@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+## v1.2.13 — Automatic repair loop
+
+- Execution failures now create a fresh bounded repair request with captured command/verification diagnostics and a new request_id.
+- Manual/Desktop repair requests are persisted as `repair_pending` and delivered through the existing file-first planner contract.
+- The Desktop switches to the linked ChatGPT chat, focuses the composer, pastes the prepared repair prompt and presses Enter automatically; it does not inspect or scrape ChatGPT output.
+- Repair loops are capped at three consecutive attempts for one user task; a successful execution or a new user message resets the counter.
+- New repair plans are never auto-approved or auto-executed in Wharness; the normal policy/approval flow remains authoritative.
+
 ## v1.2.12.1 — Baseline diagnostic fingerprints
 
 - Protected verification now compares structured TypeScript diagnostics when raw output differs only by runner/npm noise.
